  "label": "Textual description of historical brutality mapped onto visual depiction of physical abuse",
  "description": "The text 'how slaves were mistreated' is overlaid on the image, creating an analogical mapping where the text explicitly labels and frames the visual scene as an illustration of the mistreatment of slaves. The visual material (physical_abuse_scene) is mapped onto the textual concept (how slaves were mistreated) to convey that the depicted violence is an example of the systemic abuse endured by enslaved people. This mapping is direct and spatially anchored, with the text positioned to encompass the entire scene.",
